Bulwark Webmail is a self-hosted webmail client for mail, calendar,
contacts and files, built on JMAP. It is developed for the Stalwart
Mail Server but works with other JMAP servers.

Features include threaded mail with search and multiple accounts,
calendars and address books, file storage, themes, plugins, an admin
console with a setup wizard, settings sync across devices, OAuth/OpenID
Connect sign-in and web push notifications.

This package installs the full edition, a Next.js application run by
Node.js. The static edition is available as mail/bulwark-lite.
